<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <ResourcePreloader />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["_content/AkeroGarden.Web.Core/css/site.css"]" />
    @* No scoped-CSS bundle link here: this project has no .razor.css files, so
       AkeroGarden.Web.Public.styles.css is never generated and the link 404'd on every page load
       (since the Phase 10b project split). Add the link back if a scoped stylesheet is ever
       introduced. The admin host dropped its link too, when its last one moved into site.css. *@
    <ImportMap />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="_content/AkeroGarden.Web.Core/logo/favicon.png" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    @* js/site.js removed 2026-08-11: it added a `.scrolled` class to the header on scroll, for
       the transparent-over-hero header that direction A retired in Phase 6. No `.scrolled` rule
       has existed since. It was still loaded on every public page and still attached a scroll
       listener, to toggle a class that styled nothing. The page-specific scripts below/inside
       each page (calendar, inquiry-form, completion-form) are the only JS the public site uses. *@
    <script src="@Assets["_framework/blazor.web.js"]"></script>
</body>

</html>
